---
description: Paper-comic publishing defaults for zhengyuhong.cn notes
alwaysApply: true
---

Follow `AGENTS.md` as the canonical project instruction file.

When creating paper notes with `paper-comic`, default to Chinese `sketchnote` paper-reading notes with as many useful diagrams as the paper needs within the 1-10 page limit. Convert the final result into `notes/YYYY-MM-DD-<paper-title-slug>.md`, keep the published title close to the original paper title, put images in `assets/images/<note-slug>/`, build and test the site, and push the publication to `main` when the note is ready.
